---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import WhatsAppButton from "../../../components/WhatsAppButton.astro";
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import img from "../../../content/projects/images/capital-wave-beige-sheer-living-1.jpg";
const faqs = [{"question": "Is the price per curtain or per metre?", "answer": "Per square metre: width × height of the curtain, multiplied by the price of the type you choose."}, {"question": "Are there hidden costs?", "answer": "The price includes fabric, track and tailoring. The only extra is installation on orders under 5 curtains (5 KWD each) and a paid visit in Abdali and Subiya."}, {"question": "What is the cheapest option?", "answer": "Sheers at 5 KWD per m², then roller, wave and blackout at 6 KWD per m²."}];

---
<BaseLayout title="How Much Do Curtains Cost in Kuwait?" description="How much curtains cost in Kuwait in 2026: real prices per square metre for roller, wave, blackout, zebra and wooden blinds, with worked examples and tips." schemaType="Article" faqs={faqs} pubDate={new Date("2026-10-05")}>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-10" lang="en" dir="ltr">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-charcoal leading-tight">How Much Do Curtains Cost in Kuwait?</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-charcoal/85 leading-8">The short answer: between 5 and 13 KWD per square metre, depending on the type. Most quotes in Kuwait are given per square metre, so the easiest way to estimate is to measure your window, multiply width by height, and multiply by the price of the curtain type.</p>
    <Picture src={img} alt="Beige wave curtains with white sheers covering a full living room wall" formats={["avif"]} fallbackFormat="webp" widths={[400, 640, 900]} sizes="(min-width: 800px) 736px, 92vw" quality={60} loading="eager" class="my-6 w-full rounded-2xl" />
    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal">Price per square metre by type</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 list-disc ps-6 space-y-2 text-charcoal/85 leading-7">
      <li>Sheer curtains: 5 KWD</li>
      <li>Roller blinds, wave curtains, eyelet curtains and blackout: 6 KWD</li>
      <li>Wave curtains with a sheer on a double track: 7 KWD</li>
      <li>Zebra (day and night) blinds, and blackout with sheer: 9 KWD</li>
      <li>Wooden blinds and custom-printed roller blinds: 13 KWD</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-4 text-charcoal/85 leading-8">These are our prices and include fabric, track and tailoring. Installation is free for orders of 5 curtains or more; below that it is 5 KWD per curtain.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal">Worked examples</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 list-disc ps-6 space-y-2 text-charcoal/85 leading-7">
      <li><strong>Bedroom window 2 × 2.5 m (5 m²), blackout roller blind:</strong> 5 × 6 = 30 KWD.</li>
      <li><strong>Living room wall 4 × 3 m (12 m²), wave with sheer:</strong> 12 × 7 = 84 KWD.</li>
      <li><strong>Kitchen window 1.5 × 1.2 m (1.8 m²), wooden blind:</strong> 1.8 × 13 = 23.4 KWD.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal">What changes the final price</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-charcoal/85 leading-8">The size of the curtain (we measure the curtain, which is usually wider than the window), the type and number of layers, and whether the order reaches 5 curtains for free installation. Ordering the whole flat at once is usually cheaper than room by room. See the full <a class="text-olive underline" href="/en/curtain-prices/">price list</a>.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal">FAQ</h2>
    <div class="mt-4 space-y-4">
      {faqs.map((f) => (<div><p class="font-semibold text-charcoal">{f.question}</p><p class="mt-1 text-charcoal/80 leading-7">{f.answer}</p></div>))}
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10"><WhatsAppButton label="Get a quote on WhatsApp" /></div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
